Author: Vivek <vivekanandan.priyakumar@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Oct 1 22:39:00 2026 +1000

    Fix stage-2 booking-uncertain styling to use the amber uncertain-text class

    showErrorIn() hardcoded the error-text (red) class for every message it
    rendered, so booking-uncertain was visually identical to booking-error --
    violating the spec's requirement that uncertain states be visually distinct.
    showErrorIn() now accepts an optional CSS class, and the booking-uncertain
    call site passes uncertain-text (the amber class already defined in
    app.css but previously unused).

    Reported by reviewer during stage-2 verification.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

